      "snippet": {
        "line": 292,
        "text": "scale c j x = Real.exp (-c / x ^ 2) * x ^ (3 - (j : ℝ)) for 0 < x, proved from (Real.exp (-c / x ^ 2) / x ^ j) * x ^ 3 — this is what pins the real exponent `3 - (j:ℝ)` to the paper's δ^{3-j}"
      }
